ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-09-07T18:32:53Z","updated_at":"2025-10-28T17:26:52Z","closed_at":"2025-10-28T17:24:53Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nVerified in:\n* v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n* v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-9700K CPU @ 3.60GHz (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n### Description\n\nOn adding a .csv file to the project directory (or any subfolders), a translation file is generated if the CSV is in the right format, which is expected. However, attempting to open the .csv file either by single or double clicking generates the below error:\n>   Resource file not found:  (expected type: Translation)\n  Failed loading resource: res://test.csv. Make sure resources have been imported by opening the project in the editor at least once.\n  editor/editor_node.cpp:1278 - Condition \"!res.is_valid()\" is true. Returning: ERR_CANT_OPEN\n\nIf the user attempts to open it again, the editor will crash.\n\n### Expected Behaviour\n\nOn adding a .csv file to the project directory, the user should see a translation file generated and be able to modify the CSV file's properties in the inspector as in the [Documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_translations.html).\n\n### Steps to Replicate\n\n1. Open a new project.\n2. Create a CSV file in the appropriate Translation format, a minimal one with a single key, language, and value is attached. Save this file in the project directory so that the editor loads it.\n3. In the editor, click on the CSV file in the FileSystem pane to see the errors.\n4. Click the CSV file again to observe the crash.\n\n<img width=\"1309\" height=\"234\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/591474c6-1b58-4dbb-b857-b8af16836b95\" />\nScreenshot from testing on v4.3, the message is identical in 4.4.1.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open a new project.\n2. Create a CSV file in the appropriate Translation format, a minimal one with a single key, language, and value is attached. Save this file in the project directory so that the editor loads it.\n3. In the editor, click on the CSV file in the FileSystem pane to see the errors.\n4. Click the CSV file again to observe the crash.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[godot_translation_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22198088/godot_translation_bug.zip)\n\nTo replicate issue:\n1. Open project\n2. Click on the .csv file.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110311/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110311/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}